{"overview":"در کنار رودخانهٔ مانامادورای شهرستان سیواگانگای، داستان دربارهٔ یک زوج مسن بسیار ساده‌دل و معصوم در اواخر شصت‌ها و هفتادهای زندگی‌شان است که به‌طور ناخواسته در لابی سیاسی استخراج شن که امروز در این منطقه مسألهٔ بزرگی است، گرفتار می‌شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Set alongside on the riverbanks of Maanamadurai in the Sivagangai district, the premise is about a very gullible, innocent old couple in their late 60s, 70s who inadvertently get intertwined in the political lobby of sand mining which is currently a major issue in the local district.","tagline_en":"","runtime":131,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["D. D. Balachandran"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"Gangai Amaran","role":"Durairasu","photo":"/rh8PI15JJbeGpd1mtcajSsWEdcZ.jpg"},{"name":"Roja Selvamani","role":"Sandhanam","photo":"/vAPBxryYv76xjY3Ra7NavnFpUCy.jpg"},{"name":"Darshan Ganesan","role":"Maaravarman Sundarapandiyan","photo":"/4NBHeyFNNzhLm7pfffzLaxBurHA.jpg"},{"name":"Shrita Rao","role":"Priya","photo":"/7FtZiVvqLwgq6h5adWWeC87vEDg.jpg"},{"name":"George Mariyan","role":"Bhimarao Ambedkar","photo":"/izpHGWpHeMeOV7mXlhF19Hu7IER.jpg"},{"name":"Adukalam Naren","role":"C.M Raja Ratnam","photo":"/w3a6Qwh6pbnU2j7vJlzpyc2r7Dw.jpg","en":"Aadukalam Naren"},{"name":"Yugendran","role":"Karuththa Ravi","photo":"/rp11uukH0gA8nEXN04QWU6UvEuR.jpg"},{"name":"Bose Venkat","role":"Inspector Udayakumar","photo":"/dXmGP71AQ6lUGA3kd1xD7GexwgG.jpg"},{"name":"Archana Ravichandran","role":"VAO Podhum Ponnu","photo":"/zPq9guEsrKjbPjDwyf2miFperD8.jpg"},{"name":"Saravana Subbiah","role":"Maruthu Pandiyan","photo":"/o6OsYQnm9oXJHbmctOWLQMxBsWg.jpg"},{"name":"Sunil Reddy","role":"Davali","photo":"/w92Vawfw4DcLYSLtUeFTm46KNIe.jpg","en":"Sunil"},{"name":"Ilavarasu","role":"","photo":"/gWCREhajMvlOE49g79zyvwdpf5E.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1563192"}